302	<!-- 3 -->
303	<section id="now">
304	  <h2><span class="num">3</span>The pipeline batch 10 runs on</h2>
305	  <p class="gist">Nine roles, all Opus but a judge's second ruling. Batch 9 spent 6.88M on it <span class="src">B9 §7</span>.</p>
306	  <p class="note">A rung's chain runs from its worker to its second skeptic. Everything after the rungs is called the <b>tail</b>. Tiers are set in <span class="src">Script :51–58</span>. Each cost below is batch 9's measured spend <span class="src">B9 §7</span>.</p>
307	
308	  <ol class="roles">
309	    <li>
310	      <div class="role-head"><span class="role-name">Rung worker</span><span class="tier opus">Opus</span><span class="count">one per rung</span></div>
311	      <p>Works in its own worktree (a copy of the tree on its own branch), seeded from the one base build. Writes the test, sees it fail, commits it alone, then makes the fix and its specification text, and pushes as it goes.</p>
312	      <p class="cost">Batch 9: <b>2.69M</b> over 6 agents; about <b>2.2M</b> without the VM restart <span class="src">B9 §7</span></p>
313	    </li>
314	    <li>
315	      <div class="role-head"><span class="role-name">Skeptic</span><span class="tier opus">Opus</span><span class="count">one per rung</span></div>
316	      <p>Reads the worker's transcript to see the test failed first. Runs its own small programs on the new and the old code. Builds nothing. Approves or refuses. Since 3 Oct it refuses only when the fix needs code; a wording or record fix is a <i>required correction</i> that the gather makes <span class="src">Manual</span>.</p>
317	      <p class="cost">Batch 9: <b>1.24M</b> over 4 <span class="src">B9 §7</span></p>
318	    </li>
319	    <li>
320	      <div class="role-head"><span class="role-name">Judge</span><span class="tier opus">Opus</span><span class="tier fable">Fable 2nd ruling</span></div>
321	      <p>Acts on a refusal, before any repair: it rules repair, drop or stop <span class="src">Script :2541–2552</span>. A second ruling on the same rung runs on Fable.</p>
322	      <p class="cost">Batch 9: <b>0.45M</b> over 2 <span class="src">B9 §7</span></p>
323	    </li>
324	    <li>
325	      <div class="role-head"><span class="role-name">Repair</span><span class="tier opus">Opus</span></div>
326	      <p>One round, in the rung's worktree, on the judge's ruling.</p>
327	      <p class="cost">Batch 9: <b>0.56M</b> over 2 <span class="src">B9 §7</span></p>
328	    </li>
329	    <li>
330	      <div class="role-head"><span class="role-name">Second skeptic</span><span class="tier opus">Opus</span></div>
331	      <p>Checks only the repair, against its own refusal.</p>
332	      <p class="cost">Batch 9: <b>0.40M</b> over 2 <span class="src">B9 §7</span></p>
333	    </li>
334	    <li>
335	      <div class="role-head"><span class="role-name">Gather</span><span class="tier opus">Opus</span></div>
336	      <p>Puts each approved rung on <code>main</code> as one composed commit. Writes the ledger rows (the list of known defects), the FACTS and PLAN lines and the batch record.</p>
337	      <p class="cost">Batch 9: <b>0.47M</b> <span class="src">B9 §7</span></p>
338	    </li>
339	    <li>
340	      <div class="role-head"><span class="role-name">Merged-diff review</span><span class="tier opus">Opus</span></div>
341	      <p>Runs beside the gate. Reads the merged diff and the records. A blocking finding in code gets its own judge and one repair.</p>
342	      <p class="cost">Batch 9: <b>0.42M</b>, its judge <b>0.19M</b>, its repair <b>0.20M</b> <span class="src">B9 §7</span></p>
343	    </li>
344	    <li>
345	      <div class="role-head"><span class="role-name">Gate</span><span class="tier opus">Opus</span></div>
346	      <p>Builds the merged tree once. Runs <code>testFast</code>, <code>testSystem</code>, the four-thread <code>atomic</code> runs, the compile ladder, and the two report-only stages: the checker count and the distance, two measures of what the compiled checker still refuses in the library <span class="src">Manual</span>.</p>
347	      <p class="cost">Batch 9: <b>0.13M</b> <span class="src">B9 §7</span></p>
348	    </li>
349	    <li>
350	      <div class="role-head"><span class="role-name">Commit</span><span class="tier opus">Opus</span></div>
351	      <p>Lands the gate's tables, pushes <code>main</code>, and starts the two microGPT runs under walk.</p>
352	      <p class="cost">Batch 9: <b>0.15M</b> <span class="src">B9 §7</span></p>
353	    </li>
354	  </ol>
355	
356	  <div class="total">
357	    <p><b>Batch 9, measured:</b> 6.88M over 22 agents, 5 h 44 min. The tail: 1.56M <span class="src">B9 §7</span>.</p>
358	    <p><b>Batch 10 on this pipeline, the record's estimate:</b> 6M to 7M, 14 to 18 agents, 6 to 9 hours <span class="src">Rec §1</span>.</p>
359	  </div>
360	</section>
